# User input example

mogwai.reset
console.clear

"What's your name? "
console.prompt -> 'name'
"Hello, {! name}!" eval ?

"How old are you? "
console.prompt -> 'age'
"You are {! age} years old." eval ?

"What's your favorite color? " 
console.prompt -> 'favorite'
"Nice! {! favorite} is a great color!" eval ?
